+			 i.e. values above 100 make religions less likely to spread. -->
+		<element type="iReligionSpreadDivPercent" minOccurs="0"/>
+		<!-- advc.252: start -->
+		<!-- Affects the per-turn probability of Random Events, specifically,
+			 the number of sides of the virtually rolled die. A percentage above
+			 100 means a higher number of sides and smaller event probabilities.
+			 Also affects the length of the period of game start during which
+			 no events can occur - the higher the percentage, the longer the
+			 period without events.
+			 Feature growth and resource discovery are not affected by this,
+			 those special events get adjusted to game length. -->
+		<element type="iEventRollSidesPercent" minOccurs="0"/>
+		<!-- Adjusts the frequency of diplo votes. A percentage above 100 means
